WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.802
This query produces three SELECT blocks.

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:07.967
Each one assigns a month date and uses the corresponding wide revenue column.

00:00:07.967 --> 00:00:10.332
UNION ALL stacks the results.

00:00:10.332 --> 00:00:16.097
Run it and verify that one product row has expanded into multiple product-month rows.

00:00:16.097 --> 00:00:23.127
A pivot converts category values into columns, usually through conditional aggregation in portable SQL.

00:00:23.127 --> 00:00:26.737
Each target column needs a clear aggregation rule.

00:00:26.737 --> 00:00:32.132
Before pivoting, check whether the source contains more than one value for the same row-key and category

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:33.440
combination.
